{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02900","headline":"奉和太子纳妃太平公主出降三首 一 · 裴守真","name":"奉和太子纳妃太平公主出降三首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"瑜佩升青殿，穠华降紫微。\n还如桃李发，更似凤皇飞。\n金屋真离象，瑶台起婺徽。\n彩缨纷碧坐，[缋]羽泛褕衣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"裴守真","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02900.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02900","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}